<title>USA: Storage Technology sets 4.5 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Storage Technology sets 4.5 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Colo. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Technology Corp said on Thursday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 4.5 million outstanding shares of the company's common stock through a privately negotiated stock repurchase agreement.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be retired. There were about 61.2 million shares of StorageTek common stock outstanding as of August 2, the company said in a press release.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
